<title>GERMANY: Bayer group Q3 pre-tax profit up 8.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Bayer group Q3 pre-tax profit up 8.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30 (in millions of marks unless stated).</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     981     vs 906</p>
<p>    Group sales				  11,747  vs 10,843</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    400     vs 390</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 4,355   vs 4,401</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals and drugs group is Bayer AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
